.TH "PVSECRET-CREATE-UPDATE-CCK" "1" "2026-08-11" "s390-tools" "UV\-Secret Manual"
.nh
.ad l
.SH "NAME"
pvsecret-create-update-cck \- Update customer communication key
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
.fam C
\fBpvsecret\fR \fBcreate\fR \fBupdate\-cck\fR \fB\-\-secret\fR <CCK\-FILE>
\fBpvsecret\fR \fBcreate\fR \fBupdate\-cck\fR \fB\-\-secret\fR <CCK\-FILE>
.fam C
.fi
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Insert a customer communication key into a guest.
.SH "OPTIONS"
\-\-secret <CCK\-FILE>
.RS 4
Use CCK\-FILE as new CCK.
.RE
.PP
\-h, \-\-help
.RS 4
Print help (see a summary with \fB\-h\fR).
.RE
.SH "SEE ALSO"
\fBpvsecret\fR(1), \fBpvsecret\-create\fR(1)